WEBVTT

00:00:02.897 --> 00:00:03.460
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.579 --> 00:00:06.914
<v><b>A:</b></v> On my desk I have my computer.

00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:10.338
I have some pens and pieces of paper.

00:00:10.957 --> 00:00:14.093
I have a lamp, and a photo of my family.

00:00:14.378 --> 00:00:17.551
Oh, and a phone. It’s very neat.

00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:19.968
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:21.055 --> 00:00:25.849
<v><b>B:</b></v> In my study I have a desk, a table, and two chairs.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.722
I have a lot of books and a big dictionary on the desk –

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:32.744
it isn’t very neat.

00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:36.163
And I have a map of the world on the wall.

00:00:38.256 --> 00:00:38.907
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:40.025 --> 00:00:42.889
<v><b>C:</b></v> I have a lot of things in my bag.

00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:45.330
I have my phone.

00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:48.862
I have the charger for my phone.

00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:54.159
I have my sunglasses, tissues, and a mask.

00:00:54.873 --> 00:00:59.177
And I have my house keys and my change purse.